<pre><code>public ActionResult ActivateStudy()
{
    // code elided for clarity

    return View( "Index" );
}
</code></pre>

<p>And this works.</p>

<p>It's at times like these where you realize you really don't know very much. Back to the books and code editor. Learn by doing.</p>
